  "notes": [
    "**Cuidar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Often used with \"de\" or \"a\": *cuidar de los niños* or *cuidar a los niños* (to take care of the children)",
    "Often used reflexively: **cuidarse** (to take care of oneself)",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Cuido a mi hermano* (I look after my brother)",
    "*Cuidar las plantas* (to take care of the plants)",
    "*¡Cuídate!* (Take care! - common goodbye phrase)",
    "Related noun: **el cuidado** (care)",
    "Expression: *tener cuidado* (to be careful)"
  ],
